                "text": "World Diabetes Day is a perfect time to remember\u2013 that health care isn\u2019t a luxury \u2013, it\u2019s essential.  \n104,000 Nevadans stand to lose their health insurance right now from Republican cuts, many of whom NEED their coverage to afford insulin and other life-saving medications.  \nIt\u2019s time to repeal the Republican cuts, extend health care tax credits, and put working people first. #WorldDiabetesDay #NV04 #AffordableHealthCare",
