                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019ve been sounding the alarm for months about our country\u2019s healthcare affordability crisis. \u2028Families in Nevada are feeling the squeeze with higher premiums and fewer affordable health plan options.\nMy @HouseDemocrats colleagues and I have been pushing to extend the federal tax credits, I\u2019ve even offered two bill amendments and introduced legislation. \nHealth care should never be a luxury, but that\u2019s exactly what Republicans are making it.\u2028#LowerTheCost #NV04",
