                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Medicare Part B premiums are set to jump nearly 10 percent to $202.90/month next year. It\u2019s another hit to seniors who are already facing higher health care costs from Republican \u201cBig Beautiful\u201d bill cuts and their refusal to extend health care tax credits. For the 104,000 Nevadans who stand to lose insurance or see premiums spike up to 200%, this means ZERO stability. \n \nI\u2019m fighting for solutions that protect care, lower costs, and put Nevadans first. https://t.co/S6uhTiERXC",
