                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "President Trump plunged our country into a trade war and has been dismantling our healthcare system piece by piece. That\u2019s why I\u2019m proud to have worked with @RepJohnLarson in the House and @SenWarren in the Senate to introduce the Social Security Emergency Inflation Relief Act. \n\nOur bill delivers real help to the people who need it most with a $200 per month emergency increase in Social Security benefits through July 2026. \n\nAt a time when prices are rising and families are stretched thin, this relief is essential. I will always fight to protect the benefits Americans have earned.",
