                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Nevadans have been loud and clear: health care is a lifeline, not a luxury. Thank you to everyone who filled out my Feedback Portal, your stories guide my work every day.\n\nAndrea\u2019s message was simple and urgent: reliable Medicare and access to mental health care. Families like hers deserve a system that supports them. I\u2019ll keep fighting to protect the care they depend on.",
