                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "The latest healthcare plan from the White House is a direct hit to families in NV-04: \nIt raises premiums. \n\nIt rolls back ACA tax credits.\nIt strips away protections people depend on. \nAs a mother from North Las Vegas told me, \u201cIf my premiums go up again, I\u2019ll have to choose between coverage and groceries.\u201d\n\nI\u2019m fighting to protect the ACA tax credits and make sure every family can see a doctor without going into debt. \nhttps://t.co/W5AdvPKrc5",
