                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Families feel it: rent is up, groceries are up, utilities are up, and healthcare costs are about to surge, too. Trump and Republicans drove prices up with tariffs, ACA cuts, and giveaways to billionaires. Now working families are left to clean up the mess. Democrats are fighting to lower costs, protect ACA subsidies, and make sure higher premiums and shrinking coverage options don\u2019t crush Nevada families. \nhttps://t.co/b7bEa4mFY5",
