                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Time is not on our side. We need to lower costs, extend ACA tax credits, and cancel the GOP\u2019s health care cuts. \n\nIf Republicans don\u2019t come to the table, families in NV-04 will face massive premium hikes. Richard from Las Vegas told me his healthcare costs could jump over $4,000 without these credits. He told me to, \u201cGet up and fight, \u201d and that\u2019s exactly what I\u2019m doing. \n\nhttps://t.co/X0lwLqqoGz",
