                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The President may call affordability a Democrat scam, but for Nevadans, it\u2019s the difference between keeping or losing healthcare coverage.\nThe same person who ran on lowering the price of eggs  now claims affordability is a \u201ccon job.\u201d My constituents know better. Families across NV-04 are feeling the impacts of higher costs.\n\nThe real scam is Republican inaction.\nWhile they refuse to extend the advanced premium tax credits, Nevadans are now facing premium hikes of 26%. These tax credits helped double ACA enrollment and drove record-low uninsured rates.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
