                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Healthcare costs are still squeezing families, and a new survey shows what we already know in Nevada: people are putting off care because it\u2019s too expensive. As Republicans block Affordable Care Act tax credit extensions, millions are at risk of losing coverage or seeing their premiums spike. I\u2019m fighting to keep health care affordable and protect every Nevadan\u2019s access to the care they need. \nhttps://t.co/tZYkK3vWZm",
