                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "ACA marketplace users are getting squeezed: with tax credits expiring soon, insurance costs are poised to nearly double for many households. Most say they can\u2019t even afford modest increases. Under these conditions, some may drop their coverage or avoid care altogether, risking their health and financial stability. That\u2019s why we\u2019re fighting to extend the tax credits, keep costs down, and protect every Nevadan\u2019s right to affordable health care because basic health care should be a right, not a luxury.\n\nhttps://t.co/i4tbUK8pv3",
