                "text": "Real health care solutions don\u2019t cut coverage. \n\nIf Republicans truly wanted a bipartisan solution, they\u2019d negotiate on what helps families: canceling healthcare cuts, lowering costs, and extending the ACA premium tax credits. \n\nHealth care shouldn\u2019t be a partisan game. It\u2019s a human right. \nhttps://t.co/kAPlhDO6mg",
