                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Reckless Republican policies, from chaotic Trump tariffs to the Big Ugly Bill, are driving up the costs of everything families rely on: groceries, electricity, healthcare, housing, and the holidays. \n\nUnder Trump and Republicans, holiday gift prices are up 26% since last year, and two-thirds of families say they\u2019re stressed about affording holiday expenses. \n\nYou deserve better. That\u2019s why I\u2019m fighting to lower costs and help families breathe easier this season and beyond. \nhttps://t.co/rRxvw74Cod",
